SECA DEMO SAMPLE - NOT AN EXECUTABLE

This file intentionally has a misleading extension:
fake_invoice.pdf.exe

Purpose:
- Demonstrate suspicious filename and extension analysis.
- Show how attackers may hide executable-looking payloads behind document names.

Safety:
- This is plain text.
- It is not a valid Windows executable.
- It performs no action.

Demo keywords for static scanners:
powershell -enc
cmd.exe /c
CreateRemoteThread
VirtualAlloc
http://update-login.example.invalid/payload
